WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.656
The Drive source points to a Steering Committee and a Technical Advisory Committee; the current charter sets the boundary.

2
00:00:06.656 --> 00:00:11.838
The Steering Committee owns working-group strategy, scope, programme plan, roadmap, and budget.

3
00:00:11.838 --> 00:00:17.294
The TAC recommends projects, coordinates releases, and defines policies for OpenHW-branded releases.

4
00:00:17.294 --> 00:00:21.113
Projects still make project-level decisions through their communities.

5
00:00:21.113 --> 00:00:26.350
Eclipse says a working group may guide and support projects, but does not direct or manage them.

